# PAGE 13 — EXPORTABLE FIELD BRIEF

## 79. Composition and behaviour

Generate a real report document, not a screenshot. Header: Field Shift brand, farm/field, general region, report date, report/model ID, scope and evidence coverage. Photo/map thumbnail only if real or clearly illustrative. Include assessment summary, main findings, risks, recommended actions/due windows, environmental context, source/limitation notes and Advanced method appendix. Multi-field report starts with farm summary, then separate per-field sections; never mix scopes without labeling.

